OL,3,GNEWSA#350k stolen racing car found
OL,4,Aafter ransom call
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stolen racing car worth about
OL,7,F#350,000 has been found, its team says,
OL,8,Fafter its boss was sent a FaceTime
OL,9,Fvideo of the vehicle in an attempt to
OL,10,Fdemand a ransom.
OL,12,FBritish Touring Car Championship team
OL,13,FPower Maxed Racing, based in Studley,
OL,14,FWarwickshire, England, said Dexter
OL,15,FPatterson's BTCC Audi was taken from a
OL,16,Fcompound at the ExCeL London exhibition
OL,17,Fcentre on Wednesday night.
OL,19,FTeam principal Adam Weaver said he told
OL,20,Fthe caller he could not organise the
OL,21,Fcash on Thursday night and wanted to
OL,22,Fsleep on it.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
