OL,3,GNEWSA#350k stolen racing car found
OL,4,Aafter ransom call
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the team, whose former headquarters
OL,7,Fnear Evesham was destroyed in a fire in
OL,8,F2025, said he later received another
OL,9,Fcall saying police had been alerted and
OL,10,Fthe car was on a road still in London.
